#:kivy 2.3.0
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# aipromptgallery.kv
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root KV file for AI Prompt Gallery.
#
# This file is intentionally left mostly empty for now, since no
# screens have been created yet (per project requirements).
#
# Later, this file can be used to:
#   - Import individual screen .kv files with #:include
#   - Define global/reusable style rules
#   - Define app-wide widget templates
#
# Example (for future use):
# #:include screens/home_screen.kv
# #:include widgets/prompt_card.kv
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
